WEBVTT

00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:44.350
One hundred years ago,
King Kyle fought the Dark Lord Angmund.

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:49.650
Time passed, and the Holy Sword
sought a new master.

00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:56.690
A brave warrior,
to carry the will of King Kyle...

00:00:59.230 --> 00:01:04.100
<i>When the red-stained night comes</i>

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:09.310
<i>I paint you on the sky</i>

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:19.720
"KING's RAID:
Successors of the Will"

00:01:20.350 --> 00:01:24.190
<i>The hidden truth</i>

00:01:24.190 --> 00:01:28.730
<i>The sudden suffocation</i>

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:33.980
<i>You are so distant, fading</i>

00:01:33.980 --> 00:01:38.650
<i>Do you feel it too?</i>

00:01:38.650 --> 00:01:40.980
<i>Crossing blades</i>

00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:43.810
<i>Cannot touch</i>

00:01:43.810 --> 00:01:48.440
<i>The sadness that lies beyond</i>

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:50.940
<i>I just want to see you</i>

00:01:50.940 --> 00:01:54.900
<i>I search for you</i>

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:58.350
<i>Now, Eclipse</i>

00:01:58.350 --> 00:02:03.230
<i>I always want to be by your side</i>

00:02:03.230 --> 00:02:05.900
<i>I send a wish to the sky</i>

00:02:05.900 --> 00:02:08.100
<i>I believe in destiny</i>

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:10.520
<i>When the sun and moon meet</i>

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:12.980
<i>At that moment</i>

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:16.190
<i>I run to you</i>

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:20.060
<i>With all my heart</i>

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:33.920
<i></i>The Battle of

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:33.920
<i></i>the World Tree

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:52.310
Clause! Everyone! Are you all right?!

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:53.060
Yeah!

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:54.190
Kasel!

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:56.810
The sword that the Dark Lord is holding--
that's the Holy Sword Aea!

00:02:58.480 --> 00:03:00.270
That's the Holy Sword Aea...

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:04.600
You have come.

00:03:04.600 --> 00:03:08.350
You're not the Dark Lord Angmund,
you're King Kyle!

00:03:08.350 --> 00:03:10.230
Please wake up!

00:03:14.520 --> 00:03:17.560
King Kyle...? What does that mean?!

00:03:42.980 --> 00:03:48.310
Please recall the people
you tried to protect!

00:03:48.310 --> 00:03:50.190
About my mother!

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:03.560
Selene!

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:15.150
We need the Holy Sword...!

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:18.150
If we work together,
we can create an opening!

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:21.850
Kasel! Jump in and grab the Holy Sword!

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:36.850
Is it just me or did he get stronger?!

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:40.650
Was the Holy Sword limiting his power...?

00:05:50.940 --> 00:05:52.350
A sword...

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:04.730
Get the Holy Sword!

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:48.900
Is that the power of the Holy Sword?!

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:40.980
Kasel...

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:50.560
Demia!

00:07:50.560 --> 00:07:51.690
Everyone...

00:07:51.690 --> 00:07:53.560
Kasel...

00:07:53.560 --> 00:07:55.650
Don't give up!

00:07:55.650 --> 00:07:57.480
Fight!

00:08:33.940 --> 00:08:34.810
Cleo!

00:08:34.810 --> 00:08:38.690
Stay right there!

00:08:57.190 --> 00:08:59.520
How's that...?

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:08.350
No...

00:09:18.770 --> 00:09:21.900
I can't give up!

00:09:21.900 --> 00:09:25.350
For all the people
who've lost their lives...

00:09:25.350 --> 00:09:28.730
For all the people who've suffered
because of the Demons!

00:09:31.560 --> 00:09:37.100
I won't let him destroy the things
King Kyle tried to protect with his life!

00:09:39.810 --> 00:09:41.770
I will stop him!

00:10:37.810 --> 00:10:39.730
A-Are you all right...?

00:10:39.730 --> 00:10:41.730
M-More or less...

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:55.310
Kyle...

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:14.770
Kasel!

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:16.440
Stand back, Frey!

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:19.980
Get away!

00:11:24.650 --> 00:11:26.940
I said get away!

00:11:26.940 --> 00:11:30.980
Kasel, no, no...

00:11:30.980 --> 00:11:33.190
I can't lose you!

00:11:33.190 --> 00:11:37.350
You're the most precious to me!

00:11:43.310 --> 00:11:45.350
F-Frey...

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:54.900
Illya...

00:12:58.560 --> 00:13:00.020
Kyle...

00:13:08.020 --> 00:13:12.310
I'm glad Lua granted me my wish...

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:14.190
My son.

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:18.060
You know who I am?

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:23.770
Yes. Even while I was trapped in darkness,
I could still hear your voice.

00:13:23.770 --> 00:13:29.350
What do you mean?
Didn't Lua betray you back then?

00:13:29.350 --> 00:13:30.650
No.

00:13:32.600 --> 00:13:34.650
Back then, I...

00:13:34.650 --> 00:13:39.770
I let go of the Holy Sword's power
on my own, to protect the Holy Sword.

00:13:41.190 --> 00:13:45.270
Lua granted me that wish

00:13:45.270 --> 00:13:48.690
and made my son the heir...

00:13:48.690 --> 00:13:50.560
That's...

00:13:50.560 --> 00:13:53.520
I'm sorry, Maria...

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:00.150
It was a long fight...

00:14:04.060 --> 00:14:05.560
Father...!

00:14:10.230 --> 00:14:11.770
I love you.

00:14:25.350 --> 00:14:30.270
King Kyle... My father,
he has passed away, hasn't he?

00:14:30.270 --> 00:14:33.150
Yes.

00:14:33.150 --> 00:14:37.980
About Kyle, about Illya's pendant...

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:40.980
I didn't understand anything.

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:44.060
Hate took everything from me.

00:14:44.060 --> 00:14:46.600
I can't even shed a tear
at a time like this.

00:14:51.060 --> 00:14:54.900
Thank you for saving Kyle.

00:14:57.900 --> 00:14:59.310
Miss Maria...

00:15:01.940 --> 00:15:07.730
I only wish I could have delivered
my true feelings honestly, like you did.

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:16.400
It's over...!

00:15:16.400 --> 00:15:18.480
You beat the Dark Lord!

00:15:18.480 --> 00:15:19.850
Yeah.

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:23.480
You protected everyone, Kasel!

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:25.020
What?!

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:27.060
Wh-Wh-What are you doing?!

00:15:27.060 --> 00:15:28.850
This is a victory pose.

00:15:28.850 --> 00:15:30.690
How so? What?!

00:15:30.690 --> 00:15:32.520
Jump in, Selene!

00:15:32.520 --> 00:15:34.480
What?! T-T-To what?

00:15:34.480 --> 00:15:36.440
There, there. Calm down.

00:15:36.440 --> 00:15:40.520
You're always like that! "There, there,"
and, "Calm down," and such!

00:15:44.480 --> 00:15:46.810
Illya's wish came true.

00:16:19.270 --> 00:16:21.020
The Dark Lord was eliminated,

00:16:21.020 --> 00:16:25.560
and with that,
Demonic activities slowed down.

00:16:25.560 --> 00:16:27.650
After the battle at the World Tree,

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:31.440
there have been no reports
of damages due to Demonic attacks.

00:16:31.440 --> 00:16:35.900
We should be able to live in peace,
at least for the foreseeable future.

00:16:39.310 --> 00:16:42.440
The citizens of Orvelia
see Riheet as a hero.

00:16:42.440 --> 00:16:45.230
Prejudice against the Dark Elves
has weakened,

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:47.770
and relations are starting to improve.

00:16:47.770 --> 00:16:52.480
I think we can finally say
our kingdom is becoming peaceful.

00:16:52.480 --> 00:16:56.900
That said, not everything is perfect...

00:16:56.900 --> 00:17:01.400
Some nobles are not in favor
of the way things are going,

00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:05.600
and the Dark Elves also have
some enmity towards us.

00:17:05.600 --> 00:17:09.190
However, I plan to change this kingdom,

00:17:09.190 --> 00:17:12.020
so that no tragic conflicts
ever happen again.

00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:18.350
You make me proud, Scarlet.

00:17:20.020 --> 00:17:21.940
Father...!

00:17:26.850 --> 00:17:27.850
What is it?

00:17:27.850 --> 00:17:30.730
Oh, how you've grown, Your Highness...

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:36.060
We the nobles must also change.
I will do everything in my power.

00:17:36.060 --> 00:17:37.520
I'm counting on you.

00:17:37.520 --> 00:17:41.400
Your Highness,
Riheet would like to meet with you.

00:17:44.400 --> 00:17:48.150
Good, you came at just the right time.
I have good news.

00:17:49.600 --> 00:17:52.600
A lot of people want to make you a noble.

00:17:52.600 --> 00:17:56.600
I got everyone to sign off on giving you
the title of Honorary Noble.

00:17:57.480 --> 00:18:01.900
I'd like you to stay and support the
Guardian Knights as one of its members.

00:18:04.940 --> 00:18:06.940
I need some time.

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:08.190
Why...?

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:14.520
There are still many within the Dark Elves
who hate Illya and Orvelia.

00:18:14.520 --> 00:18:18.230
I need to meet with them
and tell them the truth...

00:18:18.230 --> 00:18:24.020
The truth about Illya, and that there are
some in Orvelia with good hearts.

00:18:24.020 --> 00:18:25.310
Riheet...

00:18:25.310 --> 00:18:29.060
I won't ever be able to forgive
everything Orvelia did. But...

00:18:29.060 --> 00:18:32.060
Scarlet, I trust you.

00:18:32.060 --> 00:18:36.020
You can change this kingdom.
I sincerely believe that.

00:18:37.850 --> 00:18:41.940
I won't betray your trust.
That I swear to you.

00:18:46.150 --> 00:18:52.520
There's so much work to do.
You're going to get busy, Your Highness!

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:53.940
Yes.

00:18:57.350 --> 00:19:00.020
Kasel, you're finally a knight.

00:19:00.020 --> 00:19:02.650
Congratulations! Your dream came true!

00:19:02.650 --> 00:19:05.560
Yeah, I'm a fledgling no more!

00:19:05.560 --> 00:19:06.940
Sheesh...

00:19:06.940 --> 00:19:09.940
That's funny, coming from the hero
who beat the Dark Lord.

00:19:09.940 --> 00:19:13.600
A hero...? I'm really not.

00:19:13.600 --> 00:19:17.940
I was only able to beat the Dark Lord
because everyone helped.

00:19:22.770 --> 00:19:26.980
If Flegg could see you now,
he'd be crying in joy.

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:33.310
Perhaps.

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:39.150
All right, let's throw a promotion party!

00:19:39.150 --> 00:19:42.270
I'd love to, but I have to go immediately.

00:19:42.270 --> 00:19:44.270
Go? Go where?

00:19:44.270 --> 00:19:49.770
I don't know. But it seems like
the Holy Sword is sensing something.

00:19:49.770 --> 00:19:51.190
The Holy Sword?

00:19:51.190 --> 00:19:53.690
Yeah. I can tell...

00:19:53.690 --> 00:19:57.480
Something terrible might be
happening somewhere.

00:19:57.480 --> 00:20:00.480
I'll go on a trip to find out.

00:20:02.310 --> 00:20:05.560
You can count on me
to keep an eye on Kasel.

00:20:05.560 --> 00:20:08.350
We'll let you know as soon as we find out.

00:20:10.690 --> 00:20:13.560
I understand. I'm counting on you, Frey.

00:20:14.850 --> 00:20:16.190
Riheet.

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:19.520
I'm sorry I couldn't catch up with you.

00:20:19.520 --> 00:20:22.270
I didn't get a chance
to properly thank you.

00:20:22.270 --> 00:20:29.230
Thank you very much. The only reason
I'm here now is because you saved me!

00:20:29.230 --> 00:20:31.810
There's no need to thank me.

00:20:31.810 --> 00:20:35.520
You were saved by your allies, and Illya.

00:20:35.520 --> 00:20:37.600
Ms. Illya...?

00:20:37.600 --> 00:20:42.060
Illya created this pendant
to save King Kyle...

00:20:42.060 --> 00:20:45.690
Take this with you,
along with the Holy Sword.

00:20:45.690 --> 00:20:47.190
I understand.

00:21:01.480 --> 00:21:04.230
<i>This one wish</i>

00:21:04.230 --> 00:21:06.940
<i>Connects you and me</i>

00:21:06.940 --> 00:21:09.730
<i>I wait so impatiently for tomorrow</i>

00:21:09.730 --> 00:21:13.770
<i>Because I know you now</i>

00:21:25.230 --> 00:21:30.350
<i>A comfortable breeze passes over</i>

00:21:30.350 --> 00:21:36.230
<i>A memory in a precious place</i>

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:40.850
<i>From the day I decided to walk with you</i>

00:21:40.850 --> 00:21:47.520
<i>The promise that I hid in my heart</i>

00:21:47.520 --> 00:21:52.980
<i>I want to feel that moment, just once</i>

00:21:52.980 --> 00:21:55.270
<i>If I stretch my arm out</i>

00:21:55.270 --> 00:21:58.650
<i>I should be able to reach</i>
<i>the tomorrow in my dream</i>

00:21:58.650 --> 00:22:01.310
<i>This one wish</i>

00:22:01.310 --> 00:22:04.190
<i>I gently engrave in my heart</i>

00:22:04.190 --> 00:22:06.980
<i>The chain that connects the heart</i>

00:22:06.980 --> 00:22:09.770
<i>Cannot ever be broken</i>

00:22:09.770 --> 00:22:12.560
<i>The future which we should head to</i>

00:22:12.560 --> 00:22:15.310
<i>Beckons us to come closer</i>

00:22:15.310 --> 00:22:18.150
<i>I wait so impatiently for tomorrow</i>

00:22:18.150 --> 00:22:21.100
<i>Because I know you now</i>

00:22:37.350 --> 00:22:39.940
Wait up!

00:22:39.940 --> 00:22:42.690
Don't leave us behind!

00:22:42.690 --> 00:22:46.940
You would have totally regretted
leaving us behind! Look at this!

00:22:46.940 --> 00:22:48.520
Behold!

00:22:48.520 --> 00:22:50.270
What's in there?

00:22:50.270 --> 00:22:53.650
Dominix gave us a ton of money
for travel expenses!

00:22:53.650 --> 00:22:57.730
Let's stay at a great inn
tonight and splurge!

00:22:58.690 --> 00:23:00.480
Oh...

00:23:00.480 --> 00:23:02.520
I will manage this.

00:23:02.520 --> 00:23:03.650
Yes. That would be ideal.

00:23:03.650 --> 00:23:05.350
Come on!

00:23:05.350 --> 00:23:11.900
I was looking forward to delicious local
cuisines and skin-beautifying hot spas!

00:23:11.900 --> 00:23:14.350
As I said before,
this isn't a sightseeing trip.

00:23:14.350 --> 00:23:18.190
Ugh, here I am on babysitter duty again.

00:23:18.190 --> 00:23:21.060
You're my bodyguard, not a babysitter!

00:23:21.060 --> 00:23:22.350
Yeah, yeah.

00:23:24.230 --> 00:23:27.480
Our journey continues.

00:23:41.770 --> 00:23:46.310
No matter what kind of future awaits us...

00:23:48.770 --> 00:23:51.270
Together with our trusted friends,

00:23:51.270 --> 00:23:54.650
we go to protect everyone's smiles.
